格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 跨会话记忆库：memory_remember/recall/forget 三个工具 + 系统提示注入，agent 持久化记忆","id":"gh:1333738079","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-memory","slug":"flymysql/dsh-memory","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","memory"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 跨会话记忆库：memory_remember/recall/forget 三个工具 + 系统提示注入，agent 持久化记忆"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-memory-vault"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Maintained by @flymysql · Blog · Issues"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Cross-session memory vault for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Every DSH session starts from zero. `dsh-memory` gives your agents a persistent second brain: facts,"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" preferences, decisions, and project notes survive across sessions and are recalled automatically."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **3 model tools** — `memory_remember` / `memory_recall` / `memory_forget`\n- **Per-turn prompt inje"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ction** — the most recent entries are injected into every system-prompt assembly, so the agent start"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s each turn already aware of stored context\n- **Durable storage** — records live in a storage domain"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" (`dsh_memory` unit, json backend by default; unit names are snake_case per `UNIT_NAME_RE`)\n- **Brow"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ser management page** — a \"记忆库 / Memory\" page in Settings to browse, add, and delete entries"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The `dsh.bundle` manifest wires the `dsh-memory` row into the profile automatically. To install by h"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"dle` manifest wires the `dsh-memory` row into the profile automatically. To install by hand instead:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"then add a row to your profile `cordis.yml` (or `cordis.patch.yml`):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Tell your agent to remember things, or do it yourself:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> \"记住：这个项目的部署目标是 Windows，测试命令是 `pnpm test`。\""},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The agent calls `memory_remember` with optional tags:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"When context from an earlier session matters, the agent calls `memory_recall(query=\"Windows deploy\")"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"` — entries are scored by tag matches (×2) and content matches, newest first. Wrong or obsolete fact"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"s are removed with `memory_forget(id=\"m-...\")` or `memory_forget(tag=\"project:demo\")`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Configuration"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Key | Type | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `injectLimit` | int | 8 | Max entries injected per system-prompt assembly |\n| `recallLimit` | int "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"| 10 | Max entries returned by `memory_recall` |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Browser page"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Settings → 记忆库 (Memory). Lists all entries newest-first with tags and timestamps; quick-add and dele"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"记忆库 (Memory). Lists all entries newest-first with tags and timestamps; quick-add and delete buttons."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The page talks to the host half through the harness `webServer` service — same-origin JSON endpoints"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" (`GET/POST /dsh-memory/entries`). The dynamic-plugin prototype used the sandbox-only `harness.handl"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"e`/`host.call` package RPC; the published package uses the public route so it works in any deploymen"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"/`host.call` package RPC; the published package uses the public route so it works in any deployment."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The plugin is one cordis package:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host half: domain, tools, prompt injection, RPC handlers\n- `lib/client.js` — web "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"host half: domain, tools, prompt injection, RPC handlers\n- `lib/client.js` — web half: settings page"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
